---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Meet Henrique | Private Chef in Portugal"
  description="Learn more about ByHenrique, the cooking approach and personalised services."
>
  <main>
    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="container about-grid">
        <div>
          <img
            src="/images/four shores.jpeg"
            alt="Four Shores. One Table. — Greece, Levant, Spain and Portugal"
            class="about-logo"
            width="1254"
            height="1254"
          />

          <p class="eyebrow">About</p>

          <h1>ByHenrique</h1>

          <p class="lead">
            Four Shores. One Table.
          </p>

          <p>
            I am Henrique, the chef behind By Henrique. With roots in the Levant
            and a heart that belongs to Portugal, my cooking brings together the
            culinary cultures of Portugal, Greece, Spain and the Levant, where
            flavours flirt, traditions meet and inspiration flows freely.
          </p>

          <p>
            My philosophy is rooted in the Mediterranean spirit of generous
            hospitality. I believe beautiful food should be generous,
            thoughtfully presented and full of character. My dishes celebrate
            colour, flavour and abundance, bringing elegance and warmth to the
            table.
          </p>

          <p>
            For me, cooking goes beyond flavours. It is about connection,
            sharing, laughter and creating an atmosphere where people feel
            welcome, relaxed and together. Every table should have its own
            energy, every meal its own story and every gathering the opportunity
            to create lasting memories.
          </p>

          <p>
            Through By Henrique, I create personalised menus and private dining
            experiences for intimate dinners, family gatherings and special
            celebrations.
          </p>

          <p>
            Four Shores. One Table. A celebration of food, culture and the joy
            of being together.
          </p>

          <p>
            I am available to private Chef experiences in several regions of Portugal, from intimate dinners at home to special events. I work
            in the Algarve, Alentejo, Greater Lisbon and the Center of Portugal, including
            Faro, Albufeira, Vilamoura, Quinta do Lago, Vale do Lobo, Portimão,
            Lagos, Tavira, Tróia, Comporta, Grândola, Alcácer do Sal, Sines,
            Santiago do Cacém, Leiria and Coimbra.
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
